========================================================================
(E) permanent vs determinant — symmetry-group hardness split
========================================================================
per(A)=60  per(PAQ)=60  equal=True  (per stabilizer S_n x S_n, FINITE)
det(A)=-4.000  det(gAg^-1)=-4.000  equal=True  (det stabilizer contains GL-conjugation, POSITIVE-DIMENSIONAL)
=> tractability tracks stabilizer DIMENSION: continuous (det/trace, P) vs finite (per/H, #P);
   Mulmuley-Sohoni GCT split; THM-1780 'H leaves the ladder at n=6' is its tournament instance.
